	"data": "Purdue University — Spatial Computing Hub & CS/CGT\n\nPart of [[projects/grad-school-options|Grad School Options]] research.\n\nOverview\n\nPurdue University combines strong CS research with a rapidly growing investment in spatial computing. The Spatial Computing Hub, which opened in September 2025, is a university-level initiative spanning Computer Science, Electrical & Computer Engineering, and Computer Graphics Technology — signaling Purdue's serious commitment to XR as a strategic area. The CGT…",
